{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02912",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.88,
      "end_seconds": 5.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.25,
      "end_seconds": 10.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.29,
      "end_seconds": 16.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Um, so... aching all over. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.48,
      "end_seconds": 21.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Right, how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.92,
      "end_seconds": 27.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Erm, it's been two weeks, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.77,
      "end_seconds": 37.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.2,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.22,
      "end_seconds": 46.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "It happens every other day. I notice it more with stress and cold weather."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.98,
      "end_seconds": 50.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.21,
      "end_seconds": 57.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get poor concentration as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.38,
      "end_seconds": 60.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Have you been waking unrefreshed?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.73,
      "end_seconds": 74.95,
      "duration_seconds": 13.22,
      "text": "Yeah. Four weeks, I'd say. With waking unrefreshed, maybe a four out of ten on a bad day. The poor concentration? That's been for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.6,
      "end_seconds": 78.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "And what about rash or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.66,
      "end_seconds": 84.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Let me think, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.72,
      "end_seconds": 89.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "And what about joint swelling or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.49,
      "end_seconds": 94.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.57,
      "end_seconds": 99.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.25,
      "end_seconds": 104.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "No, uh, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.22,
      "end_seconds": 107.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.6,
      "end_seconds": 114.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.57,
      "end_seconds": 118.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.14,
      "end_seconds": 123.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.12,
      "end_seconds": 126.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Alright, what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.67,
      "end_seconds": 132.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.67,
      "end_seconds": 136.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.98,
      "end_seconds": 141.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.35,
      "end_seconds": 144.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.82,
      "end_seconds": 150.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "I had my tonsils removed as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.4,
      "end_seconds": 170.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.94,
      "end_seconds": 174.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.43,
      "end_seconds": 190.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.87,
      "end_seconds": 195.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "I mean, I've had an underactive thyroid, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.91,
      "end_seconds": 202.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "Okay, yes, an underactive thyroid is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.19,
      "end_seconds": 219.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.6,
      "end_seconds": 228.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.89,
      "text": "It's Eltroxin, 100 micrograms, every morning. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.32,
      "end_seconds": 233.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Alright, how long have you taken that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.39,
      "end_seconds": 239.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "About nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.1,
      "end_seconds": 243.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.65,
      "end_seconds": 256.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.83,
      "end_seconds": 303.67,
      "duration_seconds": 30.84,
      "text": "Okay: weight 59 kilos, heart rate 82, height 160 centimetres, saturation 98 percent, BMI works out to 23.0, temperature is 37.0 degrees, pressure 108 over 77, respiratory rate 15. Putting together what you've described, it's hard to say. Fibromyalgia is one possibility and polymyalgia another, and I'd rather not commit yet. I'd like to arrange blood tests for widespread pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.23,
      "end_seconds": 306.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.33,
      "end_seconds": 334.63,
      "duration_seconds": 22.3,
      "text": "Let's use amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. It's for pain and sleep. Gentle graded exercise such as swimming helps more than rest. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Please come and see me in six weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.48,
      "end_seconds": 338.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Um, alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.01,
      "end_seconds": 341.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}